      "text": "[7PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is currently slow from Agbara Custom Check Point to Agbara Estate gate due to congestion.\nMovement is free from Agbara Estate to Morogbo Junction and beyond to Okoafo and Badagry roundabout. \nThe stretch from Badagry roundabout to Seme Gbaji road is also moving smoothly in both directions. \nTraffic is flowing as expected in Badagry town and Ajara. \nThe return journey from Badagry roundabout to Agbara via Ijanikin is smooth. \nTraffic officers are actively managing the situation, with no major impediments reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
