      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1957505646934245663",
      "text": "[7:08PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is slightly busy at LASUTH underpass towards Kodesoh Road due to commercial activities.\nOba Akran link bridge and the outward journey from Kodesoh Road to LASUTH underpass are moving smoothly. \nIkeja GRA, Oba Akinjobi Way to Police College is clear, but the return journey from Police College to LASUTH underpass is busy. \nTraffic along Anthony way to Maryland intersection is good, and Mobolaji Bank Anthony way to Sheraton is also smooth. However, Sheraton to Ikeja proper is busy. The Local Airport link bridge is moving well in both directions. \nTraffic personnel are on ground managing the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
