      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1957511935055806657",
      "text": "[7:32PM] #Alausa_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement on Obafemi Awolowo Way is smooth from Barrack to Olowu Junction, but becomes slow from Olowu to Ikeja Underbridge due to spillover traffic from Ikeja Along Overpass. \nThe return journey has slight delays at Allen intersection and Radio junction. \nLateef Jakande Road is congested from Mobil to Omole Roundabout, and AY Junction to Wemco Junction is also busy. However, Aromire to Hacco, Mobolaji Johnson Avenue, and Dr. Nurudeen Olowopopo Avenue are moving well in both directions. \nTraffic officers are on ground managing the traffic situation. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
