      "text": "[7:36PM] #Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate \n\nBenson inw Ikorodu Interchange is slightly busy due to commercial activities.\nHowever, movement from Ikorodu Interchange to Oba Ayangburen Road and Owolowo to Ojubode is smooth. \nThere's slight congestion at Ojubode to Ladega due to rider activities. \nTraffic flows well from Ladega to Ita-Ota, and Awolowo Road to Itamaga is clear. \nThe stretch from Sabo to Ilepo Oba, LASTMA Yard, and Jubilee is moving well, but slow near First Gate due to pedestrian activity. Movement to Odogunyan is good, though slow at the approach. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
