      "text": "[8:35PM] #Sangotedo #TrafficUpdate \n\nSangotedo is moving smoothly in both directions on major routes, including Underbridge to Ado Badore Road, Underbridge to Adesanya, Adesanya to Ogombo Road, and Adesanya to ShopRite, Awoyaya, and Eleko. \n\nThe return journey from Eleko to Underbridge is also flowing well, with no reported impediments and personnel are on ground managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
