      "text": "[8:33PM] #Agege #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is busy on Ijaye Road to Oba Ogunji and Old Abeokuta Motor Road from Isokoko to Total Underbridge due to return journey and traffic alternation. \nMovement is smooth from Nitel to Abattoir and on Old Ipaja Road from Oke Koto to Shofunde. \nTraffic is also flowing well on Alfa Nla and from Capitol to Oniwaya Junction. Congestion is reported on Oba Akran to Akilo due to high traffic volume. \nGuinness to Akanni Doherty is moving smoothly. \nTraffic personnel are on ground managing the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
