      "text": "[8:51PM] #OguduAlapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nDescending Gbagada Bridge and Olopomeji connecting Car Wash, Ifako down to Ogudu is good.\nOgudu towards Estate Alapere, Apostolic Church, Ojota Bridge down to Ikosi junction is a smooth journey.\nIkosi junction connecting Tollgate, Secretariat down to Otedola Bridge is very good.\nReturn journey from Otedola Bridge connecting Secretariat down to Car wash is perfectly okay.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
